- Segment EBITDA in Q3: Reefer Services 2.6 (17.2%), Pharma Lanes 1.8 (26.1%), Monitoring & Software 1.5 (31.3%), Yard & Trans-shipment 0.4 (14.8%), central costs -0.4
- Energy line is mostly reefer plug-in power at RTM-3 and GDY-1; fuel is yard equipment diesel
Notes: Price and mix includes the 1 March 2024 rate card (see rate_card_2024). The wage line is only a partial year of the Gdynia yard grid change, expect it to get bigger.

