=== slide
# Net debt and covenants at 30 September 2024
| Item | EUR m |
| Term loan (Nordhafen Bank AG) | 38.5 |
| RCF drawn (limit 15.0) | 7.0 |
| IFRS 16 lease liabilities | 21.7 |
| Cash and equivalents | -9.7 |
| Net debt | 57.5 |
- LTM EBITDA EUR 21.0m, so net debt / EBITDA is 2.74x vs maximum 3.50x
- Headroom: EBITDA could fall by EUR 4.6m (21.8%) before the leverage test is breached
- Interest cover 6.3x vs minimum 4.0x
- Both tests are run quarterly; compliance certificate due to the bank by 15 November 2024
Notes: LTM = Q4 2023 (5.3) plus the nine months (15.7). Headroom is measured on EBITDA, not on net debt; on net debt it would be about EUR 16.0m. The bank's own spreadsheet rounds differently, we have agreed it is the 2.74.

